# Advance Wars (USA, Rev 1): title screen to the first Field Training map, Nell's lesson on the Day 1 map (gate G9, route depth).
# Start at frame 300 then A at 340, alternating every 40 frames to frame 2600 (title, SELECT MODE, Field Training, the lessons' dialog);
# then A every 40 frames. The map with the red and blue units and Nell's text box is on screen by about frame 5000; from frame 8000 the picture
# is identical (the game waits for the player). Made for the delivered player with no save.
# frame,keyinput_active_low (the value holds until the next line)
